# What a GPU guest's kernel must have beyond kernel-needs.config (AC-T7.4.1): DRM's virtio-gpu driver,
# whose render node (/dev/dri/renderD128) Venus renders through. Shards builds it into its `gpu` variant
# alone (resources/kernel/gpu.config); scripts/guest/build.sh checks these where VARIANT has gpu, so a GPU
# pool never boots a kernel without it.
CONFIG_DRM=y
CONFIG_DRM_VIRTIO_GPU=y
